    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game dev simulator! Now you can live it!<br><br>| BEST META QUEST VR GAME - NYX Game Awards 2023 |<br><br>Pixel Ripped 1978: An Atari Adventure is a love letter to everything ATARI. In this totally interactable environment in VR, players are caught in the eye of the hurricane in a whacky time-traveling adventure where they are one of the main programmers at ATARI and have to get INSIDE the gaming world to prevent history from being rewritten by a pesky super-villain!<br><br>Be our hero Dot's right hand in this groovy adventure!<br><br>- First-person shooter puzzles<br>- Power-ups and abilities to help you traverse your journey<br>- Fully explorable &quot;real&quot; and gaming worlds<br>- Lore-heavy storytelling<br>- Groovy 70s soundtrack<br>- Tons of easter eggs and hidden items<br>- A callback to amazing ATARI classics such as Millipede, Yars' Revenge, Swordquest, Tempest, Fast Freddie, Asteroids, Crystal Castles, and much more!<br><br>Grab your headset and get ready for some good ol'nostalgia wackiness!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game dev simulator! Now you can live it!<br><br>| BEST META QUEST VR GAME - NYX Game Awards 2023 |<br><br>Pixel Ripped 1978: An Atari Adventure is a love letter to everything ATARI. In this totally interactable environment in VR, players are caught in the eye of the hurricane in a whacky time-traveling adventure where they are one of the main programmers at ATARI and have to get INSIDE the gaming world to prevent history from being rewritten by a pesky super-villain!<br><br>Be our hero Dot's right hand in this groovy adventure!<br><br>- First-person shooter puzzles<br>- Power-ups and abilities to help you traverse your journey<br>- Fully explorable &quot;real&quot; and gaming worlds<br>- Lore-heavy storytelling<br>- Groovy 70s soundtrack<br>- Tons of easter eggs and hidden items<br>- A callback to amazing ATARI classics such as Millipede, Yars' Revenge, Swordquest, Tempest, Fast Freddie, Asteroids, Crystal Castles, and much more!<br><br>Grab your headset and get ready for some good ol'nostalgia wackiness!</p>",
